{"title":"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Aunt Anna is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0d6c36fdad9c2874053be46c7e4120f2edcf47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> years old. Caitlin is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years younger than Brianna, and Brianna is half as old as Aunt Anna. How old is Caitlin?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/c/7dc0d1d19235d16659320cf462e98ab521ecf6f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 15\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 16\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 17\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 21\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Brianna is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/e/fee6ccf09ccd42d7a9f1561249154468d2911b71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 42 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"38\" /> years old, so Caitlin is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/6/5c6414622e51fe6ca406a4d6b6153e18abd21c50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21-5=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"139\" height=\"30\" /> years old.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8\" title=\"2000 AMC 8\">2000 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2000\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First<br />Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wi